[gd_scene format=3]

; The Descent, east of the Nave (map offset (146, 10)): the end of the slice. A great drowned well opens
; below the west ledge; drowned pillars step down to the bottom (run off each one; their pale metal east
; faces are the climb back with Mag-grip). At the bottom, over dark water, two sealed ways on: a flooded
; gate going down (Ballast) and a cracked wall (Drill). Votaries pray at the edge of a balcony across the
; well and a Lamplighter drifts in the light from above: the descent the pilgrim will take later.

